{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last pilot to take to the skies when the enemy has already filled space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is burning, the fleet destroyed, and ahead lies only chaos and enemy armadas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are the first steps in a deadly war. Intense battles, your first upgrades, and your first encounters with real bosses await. They will show just how brutal this universe can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But honestly, they\u2019re your first bosses. So most likely, you\u2019ll be the one showing them who\u2019s in charge. ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available in the demo version:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 4 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrade system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of a classic arcade top-down shooter with modern effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pauses here, no time to hesitate. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade is a chance to survive a little longer. Every mission is a step toward a new deadly clash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is just the beginning. The full version offers many more missions, weapons, and enemies that will test the limits of your abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020180?t=1758301374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020180/0f931861637756821159064f57611b35c8d1bebe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758301374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020180/83c03ed1e5295e1f7cba6c7642741bc2b7e90127/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758301374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020180/83c03ed1e5295e1f7cba6c7642741bc2b7e90127/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758301374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last pilot to take to the skies when the enemy has already filled space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is burning, the fleet destroyed, and ahead lies only chaos and enemy armadas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are the first steps in a deadly war. Intense battles, your first upgrades, and your first encounters with real bosses await. They will show just how brutal this universe can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But honestly, they\u2019re your first bosses. So most likely, you\u2019ll be the one showing them who\u2019s in charge. ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available in the demo version:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 4 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrade system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere of a classic arcade top-down shooter with modern effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pauses here, no time to hesitate. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade is a chance to survive a little longer. Every mission is a step toward a new deadly clash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is just the beginning. The full version offers many more missions, weapons, and enemies that will test the limits of your abilities.</p>","developers":["Satur Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3990840","name":"Astro Flame: Starfighter"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020180/a4783c052eec1c4acd14f908892655604ebc5ae8/header.jpg?t=1758301374","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195826,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195826/movie480.mp4?t=1758301161","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195826/movie_max.mp4?t=1758301161"},"name":"Astro Flame Starfighter Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195826/d44b77fef07eb632ff7bda463770ca680b959e07/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758301161","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195826/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758301161","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195826/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758301161"}}],"name":"Astro Flame: Starfighter Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Satur Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","requi